{"login": "rvalyi", "location": "Rio de Janeiro; Brazil", "commits": [{"sha": "34a55769e477b07848495594241b3baddbcc0679", "message": "mentionned our TerminatOOOR OpenERP - Kettle plugin", "created_at": "2010-02-09T14:58:27Z", "repo": "jripple", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6f8ec90a9d8002b6a0674b972431777db409cced", "message": "the startup script compilation support was missing; now activated", "created_at": "2010-01-19T02:31:41Z", "repo": "jripple", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "90220dfbf2ba1b2e6bfb6d87d833b735ac3d26be", "message": "added support for script compilation; much like original Kettle code, reducing the gap to only the effective lack of support for the \"ScriptValuesAddedFunctions\" currently", "created_at": "2010-01-08T20:51:33Z", "repo": "jripple", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e6190fd89014a49b0faffae68c75762be124d899", "message": "replaced by README.md", "created_at": "2009-12-28T15:26:37Z", "repo": "jripple", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "de9c18d881897a9d77b55c4cec91c4f07bb7961c", "message": "improved README, added screenshots", "created_at": "2009-12-28T14:24:58Z", "repo": "jripple", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ced46a6297f27220acb655369e6306c1f58d7239", "message": "decent README file", "created_at": "2009-12-28T14:17:42Z", "repo": "jripple", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f234c357b4f6bc9908b92422f14f2f944204b423", "message": "made script variable persistent for JRuby; has no side effects for the other JSR223 languages but was required for proper JRuby execution", "created_at": "2009-12-28T13:34:34Z", "repo": "jripple", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5376803905cdd7c1e11c74e86b9c9dd5100e20e9", "message": "cleanup", "created_at": "2009-12-28T13:34:02Z", "repo": "jripple", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "131ab93885851158afac84fb00c661c241dd1d0f", "message": "refactored ScriptValuesAddedFunctions.java (Java merthods made available to the script context), but couldn't add them easily in the context in a backward compatible way: looks like JSR223 doesn't offer such a thing like ScriptableObject#defineFunctionProperties . I suggest making the methods part of an Utility object available in the scope, but that would break backward compat; this is up to Pentaho...", "created_at": "2009-12-27T00:01:46Z", "repo": "jripple", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a57f1f255126cafd22ee85303da62130c48e7d87", "message": "removed some comments things I changed I'm now sure it works, implemented a few missing things", "created_at": "2009-12-26T20:00:51Z", "repo": "jripple", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2453f4b33a4b30ed0187c7bd03d8f0867c7c664b", "message": "now able to pick up any of the JSR 223 language interpreter (including JRuby, Jython, Javascript, Groovy...) provided it's in the classpath and based on the stepname extension (because adding a GUI param sucks so much in Kettle due to the childish programming of the whole GUI. Code clean up: removed unused imports", "created_at": "2009-12-26T02:52:23Z", "repo": "jripple", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b133cc7f407735a136ebc2d797ad6b6633723657", "message": "getting simple Javascript transfos such as \"JavaScript - Add 2 and a half seconds to a Date.ktr\" sample working again, using pure JSR 223 generic interfaces!!! Removed ScriptValuesAddedFunctions for now", "created_at": "2009-12-26T00:27:08Z", "repo": "jripple", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5d885741d1765c9dcf9eccb39a0bb1c3c2ebf57d", "message": "added basic Eclipse project to get the scriptvalues_mod mostly compile", "created_at": "2009-12-25T20:02:48Z", "repo": "jripple", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ad0116a538b8464a6d405a1a1dc4d91001524e77", "message": "added required Kettle Java libs (from trunk revision r11443) to make the scriptvalues_mod package mostly compile, only Mail and Javascript stuff in ScriptValuesAddedFunctions class don't compile yet; we will freak with them later on", "created_at": "2009-12-25T19:55:40Z", "repo": "jripple", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a3fcc64cd873de783a776bc4846005ad6abbf994", "message": "initial import from the orginial scriptvalues_mod (Modified Javascript Step) from Pentaho, trunk revision r11443, we will refactor it later into a JRuby script step", "created_at": "2009-12-25T19:53:09Z", "repo": "jripple", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0d32e6f365bf67fe5dd8bf77d494e26e264559a7", "message": "first commit", "created_at": "2009-12-25T19:36:47Z", "repo": "jripple", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "828f6f001d58c95f2cdade20a5bf6343427b2c4e", "message": "update for ooor 2.0", "created_at": "2014-02-06T20:03:00Z", "repo": "terminatooor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d6bfa6dd16ad29ab74d264eaec50cda547655f91", "message": "Merge branch 'nevern02' into terminatooor2\n\nConflicts:\n\t.gitignore\n\tsrc/org/typeexit/kettle/plugin/steps/ruby/execmodels/SimpleExecutionModel.java", "created_at": "2014-02-06T16:20:40Z", "repo": "terminatooor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "501f9ae8f42cb3b73f5716af65e61144012ae5f4", "message": "Merge branch 'type-exit' into terminatooor2\n\nConflicts:\n\tlib/jruby-complete.jar\n\tsrc/org/typeexit/kettle/plugin/steps/ruby/RubyStepMeta.java\n\tsrc/org/typeexit/kettle/plugin/steps/ruby/RubyStepSyntaxHighlighter.java", "created_at": "2014-02-06T16:16:24Z", "repo": "terminatooor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ab0734f409012664c8cf6a049a015fc3521d7f0f", "message": "these gems are ignored from the git tree now", "created_at": "2014-02-06T15:58:01Z", "repo": "terminatooor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1dda80fb8d4a5b1b6eb05d892428c9cef86bdd6f", "message": "gems update", "created_at": "2013-02-23T19:02:37Z", "repo": "terminatooor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b14479837671642428f62c900cce58cfb9b34bf3", "message": "JRuby-1.7.3", "created_at": "2013-02-23T19:02:17Z", "repo": "terminatooor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8d5fb3af59bbe5cc423278fa37dbc90486c3141c", "message": "ignoring gems in git repo", "created_at": "2013-02-23T19:01:09Z", "repo": "terminatooor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a4f1a95403b49221ec4f5b98c89296003b73fbef", "message": "change for JRuby 1.7", "created_at": "2013-02-23T18:59:47Z", "repo": "terminatooor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "41de029af6ed0c441a0b8c27009a4de42b837479", "message": "fixed Akretion logo URL", "created_at": "2012-06-29T22:56:59Z", "repo": "terminatooor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "02bd7baa7dc0ad278a43566f8bb964f68ab79d23", "message": "updated to stable JRuby-1.6.7.2", "created_at": "2012-06-29T14:47:06Z", "repo": "terminatooor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c3fec538d1a381141568a34f367d1e15d675ce5e", "message": "added missing plugin image", "created_at": "2012-06-29T14:32:31Z", "repo": "terminatooor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "25f50b5be626ec4a49f627ead5e45efa7252e19e"