 require several times the json (via ooor) gem would work the first time but fail the subsequent times: the guard detecting we are not on C Ruby was not working that is why I changed from LoadError to RuntimeError. By adding the json gem and clearing the GEM_PATH and GEM_HOME previously, we also ensure we will use our patched version no matter what.", "created_at": "2011-12-08T21:56:45Z", "repo": "terminatooor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e3505435f781bb3db05d4e170eb208a27e43ff59", "message": "added json Gem (OOOR overrides JSON serialization of ActiveResource), next we need to patch it!", "created_at": "2011-12-08T21:55:06Z", "repo": "terminatooor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f176fb6cd1525de858a26b5e097c85fb4eb01428", "message": "guard against RVM magic! RVM sets GEM_HOME and GEM_PATH environment variables which can mess up with our JRuby rubygems. See coming commits", "created_at": "2011-12-08T21:53:29Z", "repo": "terminatooor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2261c2e25404d2e7cbdfb00372c7e3c724d51e39", "message": "added json gem requirement", "created_at": "2011-12-08T21:46:41Z", "repo": "terminatooor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7c11db5fc55f3103faf0a197e09579c6c3dee6ff", "message": "added OOOR + JOOOR and related Gems also with the original Gemfile enabling to bundle them", "created_at": "2011-12-08T16:01:32Z", "repo": "terminatooor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "224b6af716d0af781bde9b2dff03d544d1e5042a", "message": "README: added link to old screencast", "created_at": "2011-12-08T04:16:32Z", "repo": "terminatooor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "96c21e6a83888ea4fd1b9286e2af6896b060db48", "message": "updated README to TerminatOOOR again", "created_at": "2011-12-08T04:1